  @AT024 @R024
  Scenario: AT024 R024 acceptance
    Given A versioned test environment and authorized fixture for research
    When the implemented behavior is exercised: AI proposals qualify through evaluated research workflows and proposal-specific checks, not necessarily a backtested rule.
    Then Workflow status/version is recorded and model changes do not silently inherit evidence.

  @AT040 @R040
  Scenario: AT040 R040 acceptance
    Given A versioned test environment and authorized fixture for research
    When the implemented behavior is exercised: Open evaluation framework and permitted starter corpus; distinguish synthetic/historical/prospective evidence.
    Then Starter demonstrations never count as live trading evidence or personal learned history.

  @AT065 @R065
  Scenario: AT065 R065 acceptance
    Given A versioned test environment and authorized fixture for research
    When the implemented behavior is exercised: Separate operational qualification, investment evidence and user eligibility; family-specific actionable-use gates.
    Then Limited investment evidence allowed only under predeclared human-approved policy, never an ad-hoc exception.

  @AT084 @R084
  Scenario: AT084 R084 acceptance
    Given A versioned test environment and authorized fixture for research
    When the implemented behavior is exercised: Track all experiments, point-in-time universe membership, delistings, corporate actions, costs and test access.
